  "roadmapProgressIntro": {
    "en": "The archived panel has 138 formation dates; 137 support all three target arms. The first date has no usable raw scores and stays explicitly unsupported. On supported dates, mean score coverage in the smallest fifth is 96.28%.",
    "zh": "归档面板有138个形成日，其中137期支持三组目标。首期原始分数全部缺失，明确保留为不支持。在支持日期内，最小市值20%的平均评分覆盖率为96.28%。"
  },
  "roadmapProgressNote": {
    "en": "Target-weight change is half the absolute difference between consecutive source-date targets, averaged over 136 transitions per arm. It excludes price drift, orders and fills, and is not realized turnover or cost. These three arms have different breadth by design.",
    "zh": "目标权重变化是相邻来源日期权重差绝对值之和的一半，每组均值使用136次变化。不含价格漂移、订单或成交，不是实际换手或成本。三组持仓广度按设计不同。"
  },
  "roadmapProgressFinding": {
    "en": "Selecting stocks with low stock-level turnover did not produce the most stable target list here. The shared ledger and net-return comparison remain waiting for their input gates.",
    "zh": "本例选择个股换手低的股票，并未得到最稳定的目标名单。共同账本与净收益比较仍需满足各自输入门槛。"
  },
